msgstr "Cortex-M capability layers"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "原语、Runtime、SoC接入、实板资格分别表达"
msgstr ""
"Primitives, Runtime, SoC integration and physical qualification are "
"separate."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "FIG-15"
msgstr "FIG-15"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "连续流与丢块"
msgstr "Continuous streams and lost blocks"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "producer/block/consumer、overrun和停止排空；服务预算"
msgstr "producer/block/consumer, overrun, stop/drain and service budgets."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:134
msgid ""
"运行图必须让读者看到：factory取得已有接口以后，日常I/O直接通过face进入 "
"provider；Arch按编译目标选择；应用拥有调度和执行进度。初始化顺序不能由静态 结构图推断，静态结构图也不能代表运行时每次调用路径。"
msgstr ""
"Runtime diagrams must show that after factory lookup, ordinary I/O calls "
"faces/providers directly; Arch is compile-target-selected; applications own "
"scheduling/progression. Static structure does not determine initialization "
"order or represent every runtime call."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:138
msgid ""
"状态图中REJECTED/ACCEPTED是admission结果，不伪造为nx_request_state_t状态。 "
"SETTLED只在全部必要引用排空后发布；取消/deadline不能直接指向“存储已释放”。 "
"QUARANTINED到结束必须有实际恢复/排空证明，不暗示每个provider都有恢复API。 "
"时序图必须包含相关失败分支或链接独立失败图，并标清Task/IRQ/DMA/安全域。"
msgstr ""
"REJECTED/ACCEPTED are admission outcomes, not invented nx_request_state_t "
"enum states. Publish SETTLED only after required reference drain; "
"cancel/deadlines never point directly to reclaimed storage. Ending "
"QUARANTINED needs actual recovery/drain proof without implying every "
"provider has recovery APIs. Sequence diagrams must include failure branches "
"or link separate failure diagrams, with Task/IRQ/DMA/security domains "
"marked."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:143
msgid "图不能替代正文的调用前提与权威合同。图文冲突时暂停相关交付结论并修正来源， 不能只改图或教程隐藏规范冲突。"
msgstr ""
"Diagrams do not replace preconditions/contracts. Conflicts suspend affected "
"delivery claims until sources are corrected; changing diagrams/tutorials "
"alone must not hide contract conflicts."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:146
msgid "7. 图源、视觉和离线交付"
msgstr "7. Sources, visual quality and offline delivery"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:149
msgid "每张图同时满足："
msgstr "Every diagram satisfies:"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:151
msgid "图源可审查，图名/ID稳定；图源变更后重新生成输出。"
msgstr ""
"Reviewable source and stable names/IDs; regenerate after source changes."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:152
msgid "深色文字与清楚边界；颜色不是唯一含义，灰度下仍可区分。"
msgstr ""
"Dark text/clear boundaries; colors are not sole meaning and grayscale "
"remains distinguishable."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:153
msgid "标签短且具体，复杂说明放正文；过密时拆图，不缩小到无法阅读。"
msgstr ""
"Short specific labels with detailed prose; split dense diagrams rather than "
"shrinking unreadably."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:154
msgid "中文、英文、C符号完整，无缺字、重叠、裁切和模糊截图。"
msgstr ""
"Complete Chinese/English/C symbols without missing glyphs, overlap, clipping"
" or blurry screenshots."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:155
msgid "提供alt和caption；窄屏可以放大或独立打开SVG，不把整图强制缩成小字。"
msgstr ""
"Alt text/captions; narrow screens allow zoom/standalone SVG rather than "
"forcing tiny text."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:156
msgid "SVG默认无脚本、动画、foreignObject、外部href/资源及DOCTYPE。"
msgstr ""
"SVG defaults exclude scripts, animation, foreignObject, external "
"href/resources and DOCTYPE."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:157
msgid "图和图源随离线包交付，加载、字体说明与检查不依赖CDN。"
msgstr ""
"Offline packages include diagrams/sources; loading, font notes and checks "
"need no CDN."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:158
msgid "Graphviz及实际字体进入文档工具闭包，缺失或差异不伪称已验证。"
msgstr ""
"Graphviz/actual fonts belong to tool closure; missing/different tools never "
"claim validation."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:160
msgid ""
"SVG解析和渲染成功不证明架构正确。独立审查必须逐边核对调用/依赖、状态和 失败责任。实际显示需要检查桌面、窄屏/放大和打印；未执行项保留未验证状态。"
msgstr ""
"Successful SVG parsing/rendering does not prove architecture correctness. "
"Independent review must check every call/dependency, state and failure edge."
" Actual display checks desktop, narrow/zoom and print; unexecuted checks "
"remain unverified."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:163
msgid "8. 评审与自动化职责"
msgstr "8. Review and automation responsibilities"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "检查"
msgstr "Check"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "机器可负责"
msgstr "Machine responsibility"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "独立语义审查负责"
msgstr "Independent semantic responsibility"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "正文"
msgstr "Prose"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "格式、字段、链接、anchor、导航"
msgstr "Formatting, fields, links, anchors and navigation."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "任务完整、前提准确、术语清楚"
msgstr "Complete tasks, correct prerequisites and clear terminology."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "示例"
msgstr "Examples"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "实际解析/构建、固定输入与退出码"
msgstr "Actual parsing/building, pinned inputs and exits."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "正常/失败/恢复和所有权正确"
msgstr "Correct success/failure/recovery and ownership."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "图"
msgstr "Diagrams"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "图源语法、文件配对、SVG资源、哈希"
msgstr "Source syntax, pairs, SVG resources and hashes."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "箭头/可选项/时序/状态与代码一致"
msgstr "Arrows/options/sequences/states match code."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "翻译"
msgstr "Translation"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "源版本、缺译/fuzzy、状态"
msgstr "Source versions, missing/fuzzy messages and status."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "规范强度、单位和失败条件保持"
msgstr "Preserved normative strength, units and failure conditions."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "交付"
msgstr "Delivery"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "manifest、相对链接、实际站点身份"
msgstr "Manifests, relative links and actual site identity."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:0
msgid "支持/计划/资格边界没有混淆"
msgstr "No confusion of support, plans or qualification."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:173
msgid ""
"不通过正则扫描正文来自动判定“支持”或“安全”。新增gate行为采用实际负路径 TDD；纯正文和图源修改采用对应检查与语义评审，不新增镜像实现测试。"
msgstr ""
"Regex prose scanning never automatically decides “supported” or “safe”. New "
"gate behavior uses actual negative-path TDD. Prose/diagram-source changes "
"use applicable checks/semantic review without implementation-mirroring "
"tests."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:176
msgid ""
"审查记录至少绑定页面/图、代码与文档来源、发现、处理结果和退出条件。下列情况 必须修正后才能关闭相应任务：错误配置、借用提前回收、错误完成顺序、图中虚构"
" 模块、错误支持/HIL声明、断链、未标注的过期翻译、关键图无法阅读。"
msgstr ""
"Reviews bind pages/diagrams, code/docs sources, findings, resolution and "
"exit conditions. Correct these before closing tasks: invalid configurations,"
" early borrow reclamation, wrong completion order, invented modules, false "
"support/HIL, broken links, unmarked stale translations or unreadable "
"critical diagrams."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:180
msgid ""
"站点页面采用Markdown/MyST。每页必须显式声明`id`、`type`、`audience`和 "
"`source_language`；类型仅为`tutorial`、`how-to`、`reference`或`explanation`， "
"源语言仅为`en`或`zh_CN`。正文保持一种源语言，C符号、命令、单位和原证据身份 不翻译。另一语言通过已审gettext "
"catalog维护，同语catalog、缺译、过期和fuzzy 不得用于严格验证。预览可以显示明确标记的回退，但不能取得双语验证资格。"
msgstr ""
"Site pages use Markdown/MyST. Every page must explicitly declare `id`, "
"`type`, `audience`, and `source_language`. The only types are `tutorial`, "
"`how-to`, `reference`, and `explanation`; source languages are limited to "
"`en` and `zh_CN`. Body text uses one source language. C symbols, commands, "
"units, and original evidence identities are not translated. The opposite "
"language is maintained through reviewed gettext catalogs. Same-language "
"catalogs, missing or stale translations, and fuzzy entries cannot be used "
"for strict verification. Preview may show an explicitly marked fallback but "
"cannot obtain bilingual verification status."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:186
msgid ""
"`docs/index.md`是唯一站点首页，五个内容入口显式维护toctree，不用glob隐藏导航责任。 "
"新站不保留旧路径、旧label、redirect、薄门面或历史gateway。有效规范先归入当前 "
"权威页，再删除退役文件；历史仍由原Git提交和原外部记录追溯，不进入当前导航。"
msgstr ""
"`docs/index.md` is the sole site home page. The five content entry points "
"explicitly maintain their toctrees; globbing must not hide navigation "
"ownership. The new site retains no old paths, labels, redirects, thin "
"facades, or historical gateways. Move valid requirements into the current "
"authoritative page before deleting retired files. History remains traceable "
"through original Git commits and original external records, outside current "
"navigation."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:190
msgid ""
"统一CLI使用锁定工具执行内容检查、图源/输出校验和严格双语构建。消息全集来自 "
"当次真实提取；语义、视觉和发布检查分别绑定实际输入。规则或工作流存在不代表 检查已执行，站点验证也不建立SDK或物理HIL资格。"
msgstr ""
"The unified CLI uses locked tools for content checks, diagram source/output "
"verification, and strict bilingual builds. The complete message set comes "
"from real extraction in that invocation. Semantic, visual, and publication "
"checks are bound separately to actual inputs. The existence of a rule or "
"workflow does not establish execution; site verification does not establish "
"SDK or physical HIL qualification."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:194
msgid "9. 源码相邻 README"
msgstr "9. Source-adjacent READMEs"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:196
msgid ""
"平台自有的当前 README 以中文维护，保留代码符号、配置键、命令、单位和证据身份。 根 `README.md` 是中文仓库总入口；中英文站点使用 "
"单份canonical正文和已审对向gettext；不在同一 README 后追加一份可能漂移的另一语言合同。 "
"第三方原文、许可证、绑定来源身份的导入说明和冻结证据保留原字节；需要中文说明时， 由当前外层导航解释其范围并链接原件。"
msgstr ""
"Current platform-owned READMEs are maintained in Chinese while preserving "
"code symbols, configuration keys, commands, units, and evidence identities. "
"The root `README.md` is the Chinese repository entry point. The English and "
"Chinese site uses one canonical body and reviewed opposite-language gettext;"
" do not append a second language contract to the same README where it can "
"drift. Third-party originals, licenses, imported notes bound to source "
"identities, and frozen evidence retain their original bytes. When Chinese "
"guidance is needed, current surrounding navigation explains their scope and "
"links to the originals."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:202
msgid ""
"README 是从目录进入架构的入口。一级层解释职责、上下游、目录和代码入口、状态／ 资源所有者、主要调用链、成本与限制；SoC "
"解释精确型号和模式；Board 解释已审连接、 电气、硬件选择和未知事实；组件解释窄端口、存储、执行者和完整停止。工具／测试入口 "
"解释实际输入输出、命令、失败和验证边界。仅在存在明确维护价值的目录增加入口， 不为每一级文件夹机械建页，不抄公共头形成另一份 API 签名合同。"
msgstr ""
"READMEs provide an entry into architecture from a directory. Top-level "
"layers explain responsibilities, upstream/downstream relationships, "
"directory/code entry points, state/resource ownership, main call chains, "
"costs and limitations. SoC pages explain exact parts and modes. Board pages "
"explain reviewed connections, electrical conditions, hardware selections and"
" unknown facts. Component pages explain narrow ports, storage, executors and"
" complete stop. Tool/test entry points explain actual inputs/outputs, "
"commands, failures and verification boundaries. Add an entry point only "
"where it has clear maintenance value; do not mechanically create a page for "
"every directory level or copy public headers into a second API-signature "
"contract."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:208
msgid ""
"已有中英文追加段落须按主题合并并核对双方独有约束；迁移独有正文必须更新引用并 "
"保留唯一权威。不得用删行数或固定字数取代语义完整性。长页提供主题导航；历史结果 明确绑定原 "
"source／scope，不能写成当前资格。架构变化核对已有图册，引用 SVG 和图源， 不要另画一套同义图。"
msgstr ""
"Merge existing appended English/Chinese passages by topic and check "
"constraints unique to either language. Moving unique content requires "
"updated references and one canonical authority. Do not substitute line-count"
" reductions or fixed word limits for semantic completeness. Provide topic "
"navigation on long pages. Bind historical results explicitly to their "
"original source/scope rather than presenting current qualification. Check "
"architecture changes against the existing figure atlas and reference its "
"SVGs/sources instead of drawing a second equivalent figure."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md:213
msgid ""
"被站点 include 的 README 改动须重新实际 gettext 提取，更新父页面语言、摘要和完整 消息集合；普通非站点 README "
"另按修改清单检查本地链接、锚点和命令。SDK 携带的 README 核对真实 payload 中的目标；引用仓库独有 docs／tests 时，声明完整"
" checkout 上下文及按 manifest 的 source commit 阅读原仓库的方法，不声称 SDK 内全部相对链接 "
"可离线使用。文档改写不修改旧 SDK／归档摘要。独立评审检查 规范强度、所有权、失败责任、精确模式和支持边界，工具检查不能替代该评审。"
msgstr ""
"Changes to site-included READMEs require fresh actual gettext extraction and"
" updates to the parent page’s language, digest and complete message set. "
"Separately check local links, anchors and commands in ordinary non-site "
"READMEs against the change inventory. Verify targets against the actual "
"payload for SDK-carried READMEs. When referring to repository-only "
"docs/tests, state the full-checkout context and how to read the original "
"repository at the manifest’s source commit; do not claim all SDK-relative "
"links work offline. Documentation edits must not modify old SDK/archive "
"digests. Independent review checks normative strength, ownership, failure "
"responsibilities, exact modes and support boundaries; tool checks cannot "
"replace that review."
